# Secrets hygiene

- Never commit .env, SFDX auth URLs, passwords, tokens, private keys, or Playwright .auth sessions.
- Do not paste live auth URLs or secrets into chat, commits, or docs. Point to docs/CI_CD_SECRETS.md / docs/environment.md instead.
- Prefer local/mock/dry-run paths when a secret is unavailable; fail loudly rather than inventing credentials.
